                    <msContents>
                        <summary/>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                            <locus from="1ra" to="48vb"/>
                            <title ref="LIT1430GadlaB"/>
                            <note>The original exemplar for this copy was preserved in the convent ʾƎnda Śǝllāse (possibly 
                                <placeName ref="LOC2934EndaSe"/>) and ordered by 
                                <persName ref="PRS15558GabraMik"><roleName type="title">mamhǝr</roleName> Gabra Mikāʾel</persName>
                                for <persName ref="PRS3182ContiRo"/>, who published long excerpts in 
                                <bibl><ptr target="bm:ContiRossini1902BesuAmlak"/></bibl> probably from this text.</note>
                            <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/> ወወልድ፡ ወ<gap reason="lost"/> ቅዱስ፡ ፩ አም<gap reason="lost"/> ውእቱ፡
                                በክቡር፡ ስ<gap reason="lost"/>፡ ሥላሴ። አአትብ። <gap reason="lost"/>ጽየ። በስመ፡ ሥላሴ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied>
                                <gap reason="lost"/> አወሥእ፡ ቃልየ፡ በስመ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> <gap reason="lost"/>ሥላሴ፡ ቀመር፡ 
                                ሰማይ፡ <gap reason="lost"/>ሥላሴ፡ ፀዳለ፡ ኦርያሬ<gap reason="lost"/>ስ፡ ሥላሴ። ብርሃነ፡ እብ<gap reason="lost"/>ላ። ሥላሴ፡ ስነ። 
                                ከዋ<supplied reason="lost" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">ክ</supplied>ብት፡ ሥላሴ። መሠ<gap reason="lost"/>ምድር፡ ሥላሴ፡
                                <gap reason="lost"/>አብህት፡ ሥላ<gap reason="lost"/>በሰማይ፡ ወዘ<gap reason="lost"/>ር፡ ይሰግዱ፡ ለ<cb n="1rb"/>መሠረተ፡
                                ሥላሴ፡ ስብሐት፡ ወውዳሴ፡ እምኀቤነ፡ ይደሉ፡ ሥላሴ፡ ምሕረተ፡ ወስርየተ፡ ኃጢአት፡ ይደሉ፡ ለነ፡ እምኀበ፡ ሥላሴ፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን፡ ንዌጥን፡ በጽሐፈ፡ ገድሉ፡
                                ወዕበዩ፡ ወነጊረ፡ ዕበዩ፡ ወዜና፡ ኂሩቱ፡ ለዝ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">ን</supplied>ቱ፡ ቅዱስ፡ አቡነ፡
                                ብፁዓ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> አምላክ፡</incipit>
                            <colophon xml:id="coloph1">
                                ድኅረሰ፡ ዘአጽሐፋ፡ የኮሎ፡ <placeName ref="LOC1298Akkala">ግዛይ፡ ገዧ፡</placeName> መኰንን፡ 
                                <persName ref="PRS15175DeRossi"><roleName type="rank">ትንቲ፡</roleName> ደረሲ፡</persName> 
                                ጸሐ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">ፊ</supplied>ሁ፡ ገብረ፡ <add place="below">ማርያም፡</add>
                                ዘተወጥነ፡ በንቦት፡ በ፲፫ መዓልት፡ ወተፈጸመት፡ 
                                <date when="1900-06-19" when-custom="1892-10-19" calendar="ethiopian">በሰኔ፡ በ፲ወ፪ መዓልት፡ አመተ፡ ምሕረትሂ፡ ፲፻ወ፰፻፡ ፺ወ፪</date> 
                                በዘመነ፡ ዮሐንስ፡ ከመ፡ ይኵኖ፡ ለመድኃኒተ፡ ሥጋ፡ ወነፍስ፡ አመ፡ ዕለተ፡ ፍዳ፡ ወባዕስ። ያድኅኖ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ለወልዱ፡ ትንቲ፡ ደረሲ። ። ወያብዕዎ፡ ኀበ፡ ሐዲስ፡ 
                                መቅደስ፡ እንዘ፡ ሀሎ፡ አቡሁ፡ ብፁዓዊ፡ ቀሲስ፡ ይደምስሶ፡ ለኃጣውኤሁ፡ ብብዝኃ፡ ጸሎቱ፡ ቅዱስ፡ አሜን፡ ወአሜን፡ ይበሉ፡ መላእክት፡ ሥሉጣን።
                            </colophon>
                        </msItem>                      
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
                            <locus from="49ra" to="51ra"/>
                            <title>List of names</title>
                            <note>Possibly a list of names of members of the clergy of <placeName ref="LOC2934EndaSe"/>. The title is missing. 
                                The quire is badly damaged by fire and partly lost.</note>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/><supplied reason="lost" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">አ</supplied>ስማቲሆሙ፡
                                በኵረ፡ <gap reason="lost"/> ገብረ፡ ማርያም፡ አስራተ፡ ሥላሴ፡ አዳም፡ ሠምረ፡ አብ፡ ሠምረ፡ መንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ገብረ፡ ማርያም፡ ፊልጶስ፡ ጴጥሮስ፡ 
                                ወጳውሎስ፡</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">ገብረ፡ አምላክ፡ ዘሚካኤል፡ ክፍለ፡ ሥላሴ፡ በትረ፡ ማርያም፡ ክርስቶስ፡ አቡሁ፡ በኵረ፡ ትንሣኤ፡ ሠርፀ፡ ድንግል፡ 
                                መ<choice resp="PRS8999Strelcyn"><sic>ዘ</sic><corr>ዝ</corr></choice>ገበ፡ ሥላሴ፡ ፍቅረ፡ እግዚእ፡</explicit>
                        </msItem>
                    </msContents>
